---
title: Folding
---
sequenceDiagram
  accDescr {
    A description
    over two lines
  }
  box Aqua Team
    participant A
    participant B
  end
  rect rgb(200, 220, 255)
    loop every minute
      A->>B: ping
    end
  end
  alt ok
    B->>A: pong
  else failed
    B-xA: error
  end
  par one
    A->>B: x
  and two
    A->>B: y
  end
  critical go
    A->>B: z
  option fallback
    A->>B: w
  end
